  ($q$General Knowledge$q$, $q$Which is the largest mammal in the world?$q$, $q$The giraffe$q$, $q$The blue whale$q$, $q$The elephant$q$, $q$The hippo$q$, 'b', 'easy', $q$A blue whale can be longer than two buses.$q$),
