  ($q$Kenyan Food & Culture$q$, $q$Uji is a Kenyan breakfast dish. What is it?$q$, $q$A pancake$q$, $q$A salad$q$, $q$A porridge$q$, $q$A soup$q$, 'c', 'easy', $q$Uji can be made from millet, sorghum or maize.$q$),
  ($q$Kenyan Food & Culture$q$, $q$Which community is famous for red shukas and beadwork?$q$, $q$The Maasai$q$, $q$The Luo$q$, $q$The Meru$q$, $q$The Kamba$q$, 'a', 'easy', $q$Maasai beadwork uses colours that each carry a meaning.$q$),
